<description>&lt;p&gt;Thai forces have intensified patrols and fired warning shots along the Myanmar border after Myanmar bombs damaged a health centre and artillery struck villages in Tak and Mae Sot, prompting a temporary halt to unofficial trade. The Myanmar military warned Thai traders against supplying the KNU, while the KNU warned Thailand against supporting rival forces. Japan is providing aid to 3,300 displaced women and girls, and Malaysia approved a new train line extension to the Thai border. Myanmar refugees are filling labor gaps in Thailand as Cambodians return home, and Cambodia has made waiting villages permanent. The conflict caused 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPT0hFWHdXT3NFQzVVVTVhNzl5dkUtVnVjZUlGd202TG1ERkluOW1MWk12TU8wUU40MW1kV0FYc2NqQVBJM0lvWk05Y1FFQUM0YWMzN0tTbkRvMlBwbXBpeTA3dVhvWEl3X1B6QVRjSXlCcjRGYmpZMnhpa0ZzOW1SQ0tSRXRKUTJZZWM2alBrbmpnWDdETzd0ZHBER3poSUdCcmVhY3lTWWZickVjVEtRd0ZIRFFBRDh4Wnhr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOLXIyM2dwaXd5V3JJeUk5ZVF1WjRjYjRFYzU4VlBXaFhIbUdGZV9BYzlqVkNlU1NVdWxTaWVWaVlySEJqdW93cnRnX3JKZDM1NVREazB3cGxwakVzRXBFU2NpMlBFOHU5SDJDYjdzQ0lwamVlbF9Va082LVdCYVdQalpJbDB6N3AzazhnM1ZpTmptY3VSc1VpcFl2aWE3RzhLdGt3LWRTaEM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQdmgxby1lWHJSSUJoX18ybDBGMDVKQW92Q2hMRXN5Q0FObzZTYWF2X3R2WWVhZ0FXM0lXU2VlaTJoOFRSYzk0XzVsN09XYnM1WjUwR3NSclJuM0VNRE5CSXExTExxMk5BcXJBUkYwRTh4aGVCbU5abmt0SkhqLXVzSFhRRXBJMXppaHlYT2U5MFJYX3NRRmgydWtmRE5NTEJNTFpHNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTFB4clNsOFc1ZkxGX2ZFZ2x